    MacroCell: Name=Net_2348, Mode=(Combinatorial)
        Total # of inputs        : 2
        Total # of product terms : 2
            Clock Enable: True
        Main Equation            : 2 pterms
        (
              !Net_2338 * \EdgeDetect:last\
            + Net_2338 * !\EdgeDetect:last\
        );
        Output = Net_2348 (fanout=1)

    MacroCell: Name=\Timer:TimerUDB:status_tc\, Mode=(Combinatorial)
        Total # of inputs        : 2
        Total # of product terms : 1
            Clock Enable: True
        Main Equation            : 1 pterm
        (
              \Timer:TimerUDB:run_mode\ * \Timer:TimerUDB:per_zero\
        );
        Output = \Timer:TimerUDB:status_tc\ (fanout=1)

    MacroCell: Name=Net_2330, Mode=(Combinatorial)
        Total # of inputs        : 1
        Total # of product terms : 1
            Clock Enable: True
        Main Equation            : 1 pterm
